UID:hamilton-2026-2027-may-early@flschoolcalendar.com
DTSTAMP:20261019T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270520
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270521
SUMMARY:Early Dismissal and HCHS Baccalaureate
DESCRIPTION:School status: early dismissal\nOfficial calendar labels: Early
  Dismissal / Baccalaureate\nDistrict students have early dismissal\, but t
 he annual calendar does not specify a dismissal time. HCHS Baccalaureate i
 s a separate evening ceremony at 7 p.m. in the school auditorium. Graduate
